{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564090/extras/7f0fc974d139f87282b8007b3eec0e42.avif?t=1749273403\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564090/extras_big/7f0fc974d139f87282b8007b3eec0e42.avif?t=1749273403 width=800 height=94 /></span>Smoke Break! is a 3D stealth puzzle game where you play as Applewood, a living puff of smoke, who's hungry for a sweet, charred treat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this lighthearted adventure, mischief seekers will explore Applewood Factories \u2014 a whimsical pie-producing workshop. Cause hilarious hijinks as you delve deeper into this fantastical factory for a deliciously burnt pie!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564090/extras/43a1bb282dc2e6ef9519b06ecba9527f.avif?t=1749273403\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564090/extras_big/43a1bb282dc2e6ef9519b06ecba9527f.avif?t=1749273403 width=800 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COLLECT SMOKE TO GROW</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speedy navigation will burn away Applewood's size. Seek out smoke particles scattered around the factory and absorb them to stay puffed up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564090/extras/f6a3d6f69ef3dcd5a42ff6317d7cc95d.poster.avif?t=1749273403\" width=800 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564090/extras/f6a3d6f69ef3dcd5a42ff6317d7cc95d.webm?t=1749273403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564090/extras/f6a3d6f69ef3dcd5a42ff6317d7cc95d.mp4?t=1749273403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CAUSE MISCHIEF</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slip through vents, burrow into sacks of flour, and sabotage sweet machinery as you slink your way through pastry-packed corridors.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564090/extras/23fbbd8e6565cce3f42adcf6d4a43f4c.poster.avif?t=1749273403\" width=800 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564090/extras/23fbbd8e6565cce3f42adcf6d4a43f4c.webm?t=1749273403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564090/extras/23fbbd8e6565cce3f42adcf6d4a43f4c.mp4?t=1749273403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DON'T GET CAUGHT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beware of the adorably aggressive bakers as they make every effort to keep you out. If that\u2019s not enough, Gumbo the Janitor\u2014a one-man cleanup crew with a turbo-charged vacuum\u2014has zero tolerance for your smoky shenanigans. Stay sneaky, or it\u2019s game over!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564090/extras/bd556ea5e1d0eb9b85e3db37c120e1e6.poster.avif?t=1749273403\" width=800 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564090/extras/bd556ea5e1d0eb9b85e3db37c120e1e6.webm?t=1749273403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564090/extras/bd556ea5e1d0eb9b85e3db37c120e1e6.mp4?t=1749273403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3564090?t=1749273403","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3564090?t=1749273403","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564090/630fe3cc4973e8ad0af29d37b94b870aa5d9abdc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749273403","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564090/630fe3cc4973e8ad0af29d37b94b870aa5d9abdc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749273403","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564090/extras/7f0fc974d139f87282b8007b3eec0e42.avif?t=1749273403\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564090/extras_big/7f0fc974d139f87282b8007b3eec0e42.avif?t=1749273403 width=800 height=94 /></span>Smoke Break! is a 3D stealth puzzle game where you play as Applewood, a living puff of smoke, who's hungry for a sweet, charred treat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this lighthearted adventure, mischief seekers will explore Applewood Factories \u2014 a whimsical pie-producing workshop. Cause hilarious hijinks as you delve deeper into this fantastical factory for a deliciously burnt pie!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564090/extras/43a1bb282dc2e6ef9519b06ecba9527f.avif?t=1749273403\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564090/extras_big/43a1bb282dc2e6ef9519b06ecba9527f.avif?t=1749273403 width=800 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COLLECT SMOKE TO GROW</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speedy navigation will burn away Applewood's size. Seek out smoke particles scattered around the factory and absorb them to stay puffed up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564090/extras/f6a3d6f69ef3dcd5a42ff6317d7cc95d.poster.avif?t=1749273403\" width=800 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564090/extras/f6a3d6f69ef3dcd5a42ff6317d7cc95d.webm?t=1749273403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564090/extras/f6a3d6f69ef3dcd5a42ff6317d7cc95d.mp4?t=1749273403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CAUSE MISCHIEF</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slip through vents, burrow into sacks of flour, and sabotage sweet machinery as you slink your way through pastry-packed corridors.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564090/extras/23fbbd8e6565cce3f42adcf6d4a43f4c.poster.avif?t=1749273403\" width=800 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564090/extras/23fbbd8e6565cce3f42adcf6d4a43f4c.webm?t=1749273403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564090/extras/23fbbd8e6565cce3f42adcf6d4a43f4c.mp4?t=1749273403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DON'T GET CAUGHT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beware of the adorably aggressive bakers as they make every effort to keep you out. If that\u2019s not enough, Gumbo the Janitor\u2014a one-man cleanup crew with a turbo-charged vacuum\u2014has zero tolerance for your smoky shenanigans. Stay sneaky, or it\u2019s game over!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564090/extras/bd556ea5e1d0eb9b85e3db37c120e1e6.poster.avif?t=1749273403\" width=800 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564090/extras/bd556ea5e1d0eb9b85e3db37c120e1e6.webm?t=1749273403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564090/extras/bd556ea5e1d0eb9b85e3db37c120e1e6.mp4?t=1749273403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Applewood Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564090/59a49be4613e1075338bf562c16e507744bf782f/header.jpg?t=1749273403","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3564090/1840794793/442f96d71985a68b581be4fcdcdf1c1298c8d418/1750839889/dash_av1.mpd?t=1746734355","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3564090/1840794793/442f96d71985a68b581be4fcdcdf1c1298c8d418/1750839889/dash_h264.mpd?t=1746734355","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3564090/1840794793/442f96d71985a68b581be4fcdcdf1c1298c8d418/1750839889/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1746734355","id":257137011,"name":"Smok